---
title: Buffalo Chicken Dip
source: Matt
servings: 10
prep time: 5 minutes
cook time: 15 minutes
---

Heat @canned chicken{20%oz}(drained), @cream cheese{16%oz}, @ranch{1%cup}, @hot sauce{3/4%cups}, and @cheddar cheese{1-1/2%cups} in a #medium pot{} and stir until warm and melted.

Serve warm with @crackers or pretzels{}.
